#: usr/lib/mainuan/mainuan-gestao-drivers/mainuan_drivers/qt/main_window.py:655
msgid "The changes were applied successfully."
msgstr "นำการเปลี่ยนแปลงไปใช้สำเร็จแล้ว"

#: usr/lib/mainuan/mainuan-gestao-drivers/mainuan_drivers/qt/main_window.py:656
msgid "No driver changes were necessary."
msgstr "ไม่จำเป็นต้องเปลี่ยนไดรเวอร์"

